<h1 align="center">Big Walk: Safe Houses</h1>

<p align="center">
  <b>Um mod co-op de terror para Big Walk.</b><br>
  <i>Sobrevivência, amizade e o que escuta na floresta.</i>
</p>

<p align="center">
  <a href="https://github.com/MarceloJDCB/BigWalkSafeHouses/releases/latest/download/BigWalkSafeHouses-instalador.zip"><b>⬇ Baixar o instalador</b></a>
